    "lineup_spacing_m": 1.3,
    "lineup_per_row": 11
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "_comment": "Fractions of height. Blender axes: X = the character's left, -Y = its front, Z = up. Rings: [z, half-width, half-depth, centre y(, shoulder weight)]; limb rings: [fraction along the bone, lateral radius, depth radius(, centre y)]; head rings: [0 chin .. 1 crown, half-width, half-depth, centre y], and the front faces between the two eye_band heights take the eyes material; foot rings: [y (+ = behind the ankle), half-width, top z].",
